    {
      "start_time": 1206.96,
      "end_time": 1209.2,
      "text": "你方才唱的歌中说交往"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1209.52,
      "end_time": 1210.48,
      "text": "非仙即道"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1210.96,
      "end_time": 1212.08,
      "text": "想来对着讲经"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1212.08,
      "end_time": 1214.64,
      "text": "不是神仙怎么说出神仙的话来了"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1217.12,
      "end_time": 1222.8,
      "text": "这是灵台方寸山斜月三星洞的菩提祖师教给我的"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1224.4,
      "end_time": 1226.0,
      "text": "想必是个有本事的"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1226.96,
      "end_time": 1227.68,
      "text": "他住在何处"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1228.32,
      "end_time": 1230.56,
      "text": "顺着山路一直走"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1263.243,
      "end_time": 1263.553,
      "text": "哎呀"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1265.107,
      "end_time": 1266.497,
      "text": "什么人在此骚扰？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1268.627,
      "end_time": 1271.237,
      "text": "啊，原来是只野猴。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1271.517,
      "end_time": 1272.617,
      "text": "我不是野猴。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1272.927,
      "end_time": 1276.297,
      "text": "我是石猴，特来嗯拜见祖师的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1277.067,
      "end_time": 1281.577,
      "text": "哦，我家师傅说门外来了个寻师学道的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1281.847,
      "end_time": 1283.237,
      "text": "难道就是你？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1283.417,
      "end_time": 1284.677,
      "text": "嗯，正是，正是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1287.862,
      "end_time": 1291.542,
      "text": "既是这样，就随我进去拜见祖师吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1291.542,
      "end_time": 1291.942,
      "text": "好好好。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1292.572,
      "end_time": 1292.832,
      "text": "请。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1300.484,
      "end_time": 1301.654,
      "text": "祖师，他来了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1343.516,
      "end_time": 1346.476,
      "text": "祖师，祖师，我我是来学道的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1346.986,
      "end_time": 1347.336,
      "text": "祖师。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1351.062,
      "end_time": 1353.372,
      "text": "祖师，我我是来学道的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1360.895,
      "end_time": 1364.525,
      "text": "下站何人？到此作甚？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1365.625,
      "end_time": 1368.895,
      "text": "祖师，我我我是前来学道的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1369.365,
      "end_time": 1371.775,
      "text": "你是哪方人士？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1372.545,
      "end_time": 1375.025,
      "text": "弟子是花果山水帘洞人士。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1376.635,
      "end_time": 1377.215,
      "text": "胡说！"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1378.275,
      "end_time": 1379.885,
      "text": "把他给我赶了出去。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1380.32,
      "end_time": 1382.16,
      "text": "出去出去出去出去出去"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1383.45,
      "end_time": 1384.09,
      "text": "出去"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1387.58,
      "end_time": 1389.11,
      "text": "祖师，弟子说的是真话。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1389.52,
      "end_time": 1394.39,
      "text": "花果山到这里，隔着茫茫大海。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1394.99,
      "end_time": 1396.03,
      "text": "你是怎么来的？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1398.43,
      "end_time": 1401.65,
      "text": "历尽千辛万苦，方才来到祖师身边。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1401.94,
      "end_time": 1403.95,
      "text": "师父，嗯嗯嗯，收下我吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1404.63,
      "end_time": 1407.7,
      "text": "你姓什么？叫什么名字啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1408.33,
      "end_time": 1410.62,
      "text": "弟子是花果山石崩裂所生，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1410.78,
      "end_time": 1412.32,
      "text": "故而无名无姓。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1412.55,
      "end_time": 1416.42,
      "text": "哦，原来你是天生地长。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1419.19,
      "end_time": 1423.2,
      "text": "我看你相貌举止像个猢狲。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1424.24,
      "end_time": 1429.79,
      "text": "你就姓孙，法名悟空，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1430.56,
      "end_time": 1433.77,
      "text": "师父！师父收我了！"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1435.27,
      "end_time": 1437.65,
      "text": "我有名字了！"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1437.65,
      "end_time": 1439.83,
      "text": "我叫孙悟空啦！"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1444.621,
      "end_time": 1445.201,
      "text": "来啊"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1478.937,
      "end_time": 1480.407,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你打我呀"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1594.508,
      "end_time": 1601.288,
      "text": "显密圆通，悟道参禅。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1602.948,
      "end_time": 1609.708,
      "text": "无生无灭，气全神全。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1611.548,
      "end_time": 1617.968,
      "text": "寿可齐天，前姓名焉。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1619.388,
      "end_time": 1619.948,
      "text": "洪王"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1620.0,
      "end_time": 1625.38,
      "text": "满修满，非佛即仙。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1629.436,
      "end_time": 1630.276,
      "text": "悟空。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1633.436,
      "end_time": 1637.716,
      "text": "你在班中因何癫狂欢舞，不听我讲？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1639.036,
      "end_time": 1642.636,
      "text": "弟子听到妙处，喜不自生，嗯，望师傅恕罪。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1643.356,
      "end_time": 1650.476,
      "text": "嗯，我且问你，你到洞中多少时日了？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1651.196,
      "end_time": 1657.916,
      "text": "嗯，弟子不知年月，只记得山桃熟了七次，嗯，被我嗯饱饱吃了七回了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1658.956,
      "end_time": 1662.636,
      "text": "嗯，七年了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1668.236,
      "end_time": 1671.356,
      "text": "你想学些什么道术呢？啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1673.356,
      "end_time": 1679.836,
      "text": "师傅，嘿嘿嘿嘿，嗯，但凭师傅教我，只要有些道气，嘿嘿嘿，嗯，弟子就学。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1683.916,
      "end_time": 1689.526,
      "text": "我教你求仙问卜，驱邪避凶之术。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1691.836,
      "end_time": 1692.356,
      "text": "好吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1693.116,
      "end_time": 1696.276,
      "text": "师傅，似这般，嗯，可得长生吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1696.556,
      "end_time": 1700.076,
      "text": "嗯，不能，不能。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1701.576,
      "end_time": 1703.516,
      "text": "求仙问卜，不如自己做主。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1704.316,
      "end_time": 1705.866,
      "text": "嗯，不学，不学。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1706.396,
      "end_time": 1714.506,
      "text": "啊，我教你念佛诵经，朝真降圣，可好？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1715.486,
      "end_time": 1716.336,
      "text": "可得长生吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1717.606,
      "end_time": 1720.576,
      "text": "好似水中捞月。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1725.996,
      "end_time": 1727.516,
      "text": "师傅说话不爽快。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1727.956,
      "end_time": 1730.396,
      "text": "我是个老实人，嗯，不会打隐语。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1730.676,
      "end_time": 1732.876,
      "text": "嗯，什么叫做水中捞月？嗯？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1735.076,
      "end_time": 1739.916,
      "text": "月在长空，水中有影。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1740.0,
      "end_time": 1745.92,
      "text": "影，虽然看见，只是无法捞摸。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1746.37,
      "end_time": 1748.81,
      "text": "到底成空。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1750.743,
      "end_time": 1754.153,
      "text": "如此说来，念佛诵经，不如本事在身。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1754.793,
      "end_time": 1755.813,
      "text": "不学，不学不学。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1756.343,
      "end_time": 1760.473,
      "text": "我教你参禅打坐，戒语吃斋怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1760.853,
      "end_time": 1761.653,
      "text": "可得长生吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1762.023,
      "end_time": 1767.023,
      "text": "嗯，也是镜里观花，欲摘不能。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1769.895,
      "end_time": 1773.425,
      "text": "不学不学，打坐参禅，不如弄棒打拳。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1774.405,
      "end_time": 1775.795,
      "text": "师傅，再换个别的吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1782.838,
      "end_time": 1784.548,
      "text": "你这个猢狲！"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1785.838,
      "end_time": 1789.078,
      "text": "这也不学，那也不学。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1790.128,
      "end_time": 1792.808,
      "text": "我叫你尝尝戒尺的厉害。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1803.588,
      "end_time": 1806.188,
      "text": "哼，你这猴子，竟敢冲撞师傅。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1806.288,
      "end_time": 1807.498,
      "text": "真是的，你这个猴子。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1807.498,
      "end_time": 1809.528,
      "text": "师傅都给气走了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1809.528,
      "end_time": 1812.758,
      "text": "哎呦，这个猴子。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1815.82,
      "end_time": 1816.14,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1817.47,
      "end_time": 1817.92,
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1879.536,
      "end_time": 1880.916,
      "text": "是悟空吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1883.087,
      "end_time": 1885.437,
      "text": "师傅，弟子等候多时了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1888.562,
      "end_time": 1895.032,
      "text": "你这个猢狲，深夜不去睡觉，到我这里干什么？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1896.635,
      "end_time": 1904.515,
      "text": "师傅，白天打我三下，关闭中门，明明是要我三更时候，进后门前来学道。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1904.995,
      "end_time": 1909.315,
      "text": "师傅，师傅，您就教我些真本事吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1912.338,
      "end_time": 1917.598,
      "text": "念你虔诚好学，就传些道术给你。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1919.43,
      "end_time": 1920.01,
      "text": "我这里"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1920.088,
      "end_time": 1923.548,
      "text": "有隐身潜行变化之术。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1924.728,
      "end_time": 1926.638,
      "text": "分为两种。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1928.628,
      "end_time": 1931.978,
      "text": "一种是三十六般变化，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1933.628,
      "end_time": 1936.898,
      "text": "一种是七十二般变化。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1938.238,
      "end_time": 1941.148,
      "text": "你愿意学哪一种呢？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1941.738,
      "end_time": 1942.778,
      "text": "师傅，师傅，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1943.368,
      "end_time": 1944.478,
      "text": "弟子愿学多的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1945.138,
      "end_time": 1947.708,
      "text": "您就教我七十二般变化吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1948.348,
      "end_time": 1948.808,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2009.836,
      "end_time": 2010.566,
      "text": "悟空"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2011.786,
      "end_time": 2012.226,
      "text": "师傅"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2012.746,
      "end_time": 2016.876,
      "text": "你的飞举之功练得怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2017.116,
      "end_time": 2018.076,
      "text": "请师傅指教。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2027.932,
      "end_time": 2028.332,
      "text": "师傅"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2029.462,
      "end_time": 2031.062,
      "text": "我已能腾云驾雾了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2034.102,
      "end_time": 2036.772,
      "text": "你方才一去二三里，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2037.562,
      "end_time": 2039.392,
      "text": "离地四五丈。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2040.088,
      "end_time": 2045.298,
      "text": "算不得腾云，只能算是爬云而已。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2045.748,
      "end_time": 2046.838,
      "text": "啊？爬云？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2047.878,
      "end_time": 2057.618,
      "text": "嗯。一日之内游遍三山五岳，五洲四海，才能是腾云。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2058.288,
      "end_time": 2061.368,
      "text": "师傅，就教我腾云之术吧，啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2062.098,
      "end_time": 2067.628,
      "text": "嗯。这个却难呐，须得苦练才是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2068.298,
      "end_time": 2072.228,
      "text": "哦。再苦再难，我也要学呀。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2072.488,
      "end_time": 2082.338,
      "text": "好吧。你方才腾飞之前，先翻一个筋斗，就传给你个筋斗云吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2083.648,
      "end_time": 2084.278,
      "text": "筋斗云？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2085.028,
      "end_time": 2091.528,
      "text": "嗯。一个筋斗就是十万八千里呀。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2137.248,
      "end_time": 2139.568,
      "text": "为什么在此喧哗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2144.715,
      "end_time": 2145.395,
      "text": "悟空。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2149.027,
      "end_time": 2150.747,
      "text": "我传你变化之功，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2151.437,
      "end_time": 2153.437,
      "text": "是让你在人前卖弄的吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2153.847,
      "end_time": 2154.227,
      "text": "师傅，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2155.057,
      "end_time": 2156.827,
      "text": "弟子知错了，望师傅恕罪。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2158.339,
      "end_time": 2159.919,
      "text": "你走。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2160.0,
      "end_time": 2160.43,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2160.72,
      "end_time": 2161.85,
      "text": "啊？师父。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2163.62,
      "end_time": 2165.69,
      "text": "弟子蒙受师父传授大恩，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2166.27,
      "end_time": 2168.47,
      "text": "未能报答，怎能离去呀？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2169.43,
      "end_time": 2171.9,
      "text": "说什么报答之恩。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2173.25,
      "end_time": 2179.82,
      "text": "日后你惹出祸来，不把师父说出来就行了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2183.63,
      "end_time": 2187.7,
      "text": "从今往后，不准你说是我的徒弟。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2189.94,
      "end_time": 2192.74,
      "text": "我也不再见你。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2193.47,
      "end_time": 2197.26,
      "text": "啊？师父！师父！师父！"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2197.85,
      "end_time": 2199.78,
      "text": "师父，留下我吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2200.91,
      "end_time": 2201.87,
      "text": "记下了吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2213.64,
      "end_time": 2214.47,
      "text": "去吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2214.73,
      "end_time": 2219.83,
      "text": "此后多行善事，不可作恶。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2221.372,
      "end_time": 2224.142,
      "text": "不然我不饶你。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 2225.082,
      "end_time": 2226.912,
      "text": "弟子记下了。"
    }
  ]
}